      "problem": "Find ${lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{({x}^{3}-6x+6)^{3}}{(2x+3)^{4}}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Here, we apply the quotient rule and the power rule to get\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -3}\\frac{({x}^{3}-6x+6)^{3}}{(2x+3)^{4}} & =\\frac{{lim}_{x\\to -3}({x}^{3}-6x+6)^{3}}{{lim}_{x\\to -3}(2x+3)^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{({lim}_{x\\to -3}({x}^{3}-6x+6))}^{3}}{{({lim}_{x\\to -3}(2x+3))}^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{((-3)^{3}-6(-3)+6)^{3}}{(2(-3)+3)^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-27+18+6)^{3}}{(-6+3)^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-3)^{3}}{(-3)^{4}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{3}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
